"00:44.900" end="00:45.590">hey</span><span begin="00:45.590" end="00:45.620">, </span><span begin="00:45.620" end="00:46.010">hey</span><span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.100">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.100" end="00:47.870"><span begin="00:46.100" end="00:47.840">Ooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.870" end="00:50.540"><span begin="00:47.870" end="00:48.230">I've </span><span begin="00:48.230" end="00:48.650">never </span><span begin="00:48.650" end="00:49.220">felt </span><span begin="00:49.220" end="00:49.670">like </span><span begin="00:49.670" end="00:49.940">this </span><span begin="00:49.940" end="00:50.540">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.540" end="00:53.480"><span begin="00:50.540" end="00:50.990">Can't </span><span begin="00:50.990" end="00:51.350">pick </span><span begin="00:51.350" end="00:52.160">myself </span><span begin="00:52.160" end="00:52.520">up </span><span begin="00:52.520" end="00:52.820">off </span><span begin="00:52.820" end="00:52.910">the </span><span begin="00:52.910" end="00:53.450">floor</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.480" end="00:54.920"><span begin="00:53.480" end="00:53.810">That's </span><span begin="00:53.810" end="00:54.380">something </span><span begin="00:54.380" end="00:54.860">new</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.920" end="00:56.570"><span begin="00:54.920" end="00:55.220">I'm </span><span begin="00:55.220" end="00:55.670">stuck </span><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:55.820">with </span><span begin="00:55.820" end="00:56.450">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.570" end="01:07.940"><span begin="00:56.570" end="00:58.400">Forever</span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.520">, </span><span begin="00:58.520" end="00:59.570">ever</span><span begin="00:59.570" end="00:59.570">, </span><span begin="00:59.570" end="01:01.280">forever</span><span begin="01:01.280" end="01:01.370">, </span><span begin="01:01.370" end="01:02.390">ever</span><span begin="01:02.390" end=