 begin="01:24.350" end="01:25.400">upstairs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.790" end="01:28.340"><span begin="01:25.790" end="01:26.030">Your </span><span begin="01:26.030" end="01:26.420">ladies' </span><span begin="01:26.420" end="01:26.780">telling </span><span begin="01:26.780" end="01:26.960">you </span><span begin="01:26.960" end="01:27.200">it </span><span begin="01:27.200" end="01:27.410">ain't </span><span begin="01:27.410" end="01:28.100">fair</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.340" end="01:30.800"><span begin="01:28.340" end="01:28.490">You </span><span begin="01:28.490" end="01:28.670">threw </span><span begin="01:28.670" end="01:28.820">your </span><span begin="01:28.820" end="01:29.210">phone</span><span begin="01:29.210" end="01:29.210">, </span><span begin="01:29.210" end="01:29.630">started </span><span begin="01:29.630" end="01:30.050">tying </span><span begin="01:30.050" end="01:30.290">your </span><span begin="01:30.290" end="01:30.770">hair</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.800" end="01:32.390"><span begin="01:30.800" end="01:31.010">She </span><span begin="01:31.010" end="01:31.250">move </span><span begin="01:31.250" end="01:31.460">like </span><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:32.360">Madonna</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.390" end="01:33.710"><span begin="01:32.390" end="01:32.660">Do </span><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:32.810">what </span><span begin="01:32.810" end="01:32.990">she </span><span begin="01:32.990" end="01:33.650">wanna</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.710" end="01:36.530"><span begin="01:33.710" end="01:33.830">I </span><span begin="01:33.830" end="01:34.160">put </span><span begin="01:34.160" end="01:34.340">her </span><span begin="01:34.340" end="01:34.490">on </span><span begin="01:34.490" end="01:34.580">her </span><span begin="01:34.580" end="01:35.060">back </span><span begin="01:35.060" end="01:35.210">and </span><span begin="01:35.210" end="01:35.300">I </span><span begin="01:3